 sm:py-16 lg:px-8 lg:py-20"><div class="flex flex-col gap-10 lg:flex-row lg:gap-14"><article class="min-w-0 flex-1"><div class="flex flex-col"><h2 id="saastr-is-the-leading-global-community-and-events-brand-for-saas-founders-and-execs" data-toc="SaaStr is the leading global community and events brand for SaaS founders and execs" class="heading-mobile-large sm:heading-tablet-xlarge lg:desktop-heading-large mt-12 mb-4 scroll-mt-28 text-neutral-950 first:mt-0">SaaStr is the leading global community and events brand for SaaS founders and execs</h2><p class="desktop-body-large-blog mt-4 text-neutral-600 first:mt-0 [&amp;:empty]:hidden [&amp;:empty]:mt-0">Its reputation relies on cutting‑edge, high‑quality communication, but scaling personalized outreach to sponsors, partners, and VIP attendees was a bottleneck.</p><img alt="SaaStr Content Image" loading="lazy" width="2508" height="1110" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="mt-12 h-auto min-h-60 w-full rounded-2xl object-cover first:mt-0" style="color:transparent" sizes="(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 800px" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimages.ctfassets.net%2Fkyprwggh4muz%2F19qAkhwn5uTpmEx1YTpxNL%2F6b9728565c85a540b0fce8c9227d4adc%2FRectangle_34624496.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimages.ctfassets.net%2Fkyprwggh4muz%2F19qAkhwn5uTpmEx1YTpxNL%2F6b9728565c85a540b0fce8c9227d4adc%2FRectangle_34624496.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimages.ctfassets.net%2Fkyprwggh4muz%2F19qAkhwn5uTpmEx1YTpxNL%2F6b9728565c85a540b0fce8c9227d4adc%2FRectangle_34624496.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimages.ctfassets.net%2Fkyprwggh4muz%2F19qAkhwn5uTpmEx1YTpxNL%2F6b9728565c85a540b0fce8c9227d4adc%2FRectangle_34624496.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimages.ctfassets.net%2Fkyprwggh4muz%2F19qAkhwn5uTpmEx1YTpxNL%2F6b9728565c85a540b0fce8c9227d4adc%2FRectangle_34624496.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimages.ctfassets.net%2Fkyprwggh4muz%2F19qAkhwn5uTpmEx1YTpxNL%2F6b9728565c85a540b0fce8c9227d4adc%2FRectangle_34624496.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimages.ctfassets.net%2Fkyprwggh4muz%2F19qAkhwn5uTpmEx1YTpxNL%2F6b9728565c85a540b0fce8c9227d4adc%2FRectangle_34624496.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimages.ctfassets.net%2Fkyprwggh4muz%2F19qAkhwn5uTpmEx1YTpxNL%2F6b9728565c85a540b0fce8c9227d4adc%2FRectangle_34624496.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimages.ctfassets.net%2Fkyprwggh4muz%2F19qAkhwn5uTpmEx1YTpxNL%2F6b9728565c85a540b0fce8c9227d4adc%2FRectangle_34624496.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/><div class="mt-16 first:mt-0"><section id="the-problems-manual-research-and-difficulty-scaling-outreach" data-toc="The problems: Manual research and difficulty scaling outreach" class="flex scroll-mt-28 flex-col gap-8"><div class="flex flex-col gap-4"><h2 class="heading-mobile-large sm:heading-tablet-xlarge lg:desktop-heading-large text-neutral-950">The problems: Manual research and difficulty scaling outreach</h2><p class="desktop-body-large-blog text-neutral-600">Manual workflows could not support both quality and volume at the same time. SaaStr needed quality at scale, not just more volume.</p></div><div class="flex flex-col"><div class="flex gap-4 border-b border-primary-200 py-6 last:border-0 sm:gap-5"><span class="flex size-12 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg desktop-body-medium font-bold bg-[#fdf1ef] text-[#ef7160]">1</span><div class="flex flex-col gap-1"><h3 class="desktop-heading-small text-neutral-950">Manual research consumed hundreds of hours</h3><p class="desktop-body-large-blog text-neutral-600">Social media research and email personalization took hundreds of hours per day, slowing down outreach.</p></div></div><div class="flex gap-4 border-b border-primary-200 py-6 last:border-0 sm:gap-5"><span class="flex size-12 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg desktop-body-medium font-bold bg-[#fdf1ef] text-[#ef7160]">2</span><div class="flex flex-col gap-1"><h3 class="desktop-heading-small text-neutral-950">Scaling was impossible</h3><p class="desktop-body-large-blog text-neutral-600">Sending truly personalized emails at scale wasn’t achievable in a reasonable timeframe.</p></div></div><div class="flex gap-4 border-b border-primary-200 py-6 last:border-0 sm:gap-5"><span class="flex size-12 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg desktop-body-medium font-bold bg-[#fdf1ef] text-[#ef7160]">3</span><div class="flex flex-col gap-1"><h3 class="desktop-heading-small text-neutral-950">Brand voice was inconsistent</h3><p class="desktop-body-large-blog text-neutral-600">Different segments of SaaStr’s market required different messaging, and consistency was hard to maintain. </p></div></div><div class="flex gap-4 border-b border-primary-200 py-6 last:border-0 sm:gap-5"><span class="flex size-12 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg desktop-body-medium font-bold bg-[#fdf1ef] text-[#ef7160]">4</span><div class="flex flex-col gap-1"><h3 class="desktop-heading-small text-neutral-950">Campaigns were launching late</h3><p class="desktop-body-large-blog text-neutral-600">Given heavy research inputs, campaigns often launched over schedule, which meant any time advantages were lost. </p></div></div></div></section></div><div class="mt-16 first:mt-0"><section id="why-artisan-worked-scale-speed-and-brand-safety" data-toc="Why Artisan worked: Scale, speed, and brand safety" class="flex scroll-mt-28 flex-col gap-8"><div class="flex flex-col gap-4"><h2 class="heading-mobile-large sm:heading-tablet-xlarge lg:desktop-heading-large text-neutral-950">Why Artisan worked: Scale, speed, and brand safety</h2><p class="desktop-body-large-blog text-neutral-600">SaaStr adopted Artisan’s AI BDR to send personalized, brand‑safe emails at volume. Targets included net‑new target accounts, lapsed leads, site visitors, current sponsors, and VIP and past attendees.</p></div><div class="flex flex-col"><div class="flex gap-4 border-b border-primary-200 py-6 last:border-0 sm:gap-5"><span class="flex size-12 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg desktop-body-medium font-bold bg-primary-100 text-primary-700">1</span><div class="flex flex-col gap-1"><h3 class="desktop-heading-small text-neutral-950">Quality at scale</h3><p class="desktop-body-large-blog text-neutral-600">Messages read like a seasoned rep wrote them.</p></div></div><div class="flex gap-4 border-b border-primary-200 py-6 last:border-0 sm:gap-5"><span class="flex size-12 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg desktop-body-medium font-bold bg-primary-100 text-primary-700">2</span><div class="flex flex-col gap-1"><h3 class="desktop-heading-small text-neutral-950">Speed to launch</h3><p class="desktop-body-large-blog text-neutral-600">It takes around one hour to launch a new campaign.</p></div></div><div class="flex gap-4 border-b border-primary-200 py-6 last:border-0 sm:gap-5"><span class="flex size-12 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg desktop-body-medium font-bold bg-primary-100 text-primary-700">3</span><div class="flex flex-col gap-1"><h3 class="desktop-heading-small text-neutral-950">Full‑funnel leverage</h3><p class="desktop-body-large-blog text-neutral-600">Artisan sets meetings with new accounts and keeps pipeline warm between campaigns.</p></div></div><div class="flex gap-4 border-b border-primary-200 py-6 last:border-0 sm:gap-5"><span class="flex size-12 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg desktop-body-medium font-bold bg-primary-100 text-primary-700">4</span><div class="flex flex-col gap-1"><h3 class="desktop-heading-small text-neutral-950">Brand‑safe</h3><p class="desktop-body-large-blog text-neutral-600">AI BDR Ava maintains SaaStr&#x27;s high standard for tone and relevance.</p></div></div></div></section></div><div class="mt-16 first:mt-0"><section id="how-saastr-runs-artisan-day-to-day" data-toc="Ho