www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none"><path d="M5 10L8.53553 13.5355L15.6066 6.46448" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.25" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></span><span class="desktop-body-large-blog text-neutral-950">Team steps into warm replies and closes the loop</span></li></ul></section></div><div class="mt-16 first:mt-0"><section id="results-in-6-weeks" data-toc="Results in ~6 weeks" class="bg-gradient-lavender-ivory flex scroll-mt-28 flex-col gap-10 rounded-2xl px-6 py-12 sm:px-8 lg:py-16"><div class="flex flex-col gap-4"><h2 class="heading-mobile-large sm:heading-tablet-xlarge lg:desktop-heading-large text-neutral-950">Results in ~6 weeks</h2></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2"><div class="flex flex-col gap-2 rounded-xl bg-white p-6 lg:p-8"><p class="heading-mobile-medium sm:heading-tablet-medium lg:desktop-heading-medium text-neutral-950">6,892</p><p class="desktop-body-large-blog text-neutral-500">Emails sent (3,574 to new leads)</p></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-2 rounded-xl bg-white p-6 lg:p-8"><p class="heading-mobile-medium sm:heading-tablet-medium lg:desktop-heading-medium text-neutral-950">3.6%</p><p class="desktop-body-large-blog text-neutral-500">Positive response rate</p></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-2 rounded-xl bg-white p-6 lg:p-8"><p class="heading-mobile-medium sm:heading-tablet-medium lg:desktop-heading-medium text-neutral-950">49.4%</p><p class="desktop-body-large-blog text-neutral-500">Social media connection acceptance</p></div></div></section></div><p class="desktop-body-large-blog mt-4 text-neutral-600 first:mt-0 [&amp;:empty]:hidden [&amp;:empty]:mt-0"></p></div></article><aside class="flex shrink-0 flex-col gap-5 lg:sticky lg:top-32 lg:w-80 lg:self-start"><div class="flex flex-col rounded-2xl bg-secondary-light-ivory p-6"><div class="flex flex-col gap-1.5 border-b border-primary-100 py-4 first:pt-0 last:border-b-0 last:pb-0"><p class="